<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="6">

  <DocumentRef DateTime="20251226T200114" id="5cf207be-2fb8-4091-8ee3-b83bbdb3a89f">
    <XRef DateTime="20250719T224917" id="326d3bbb-277d-4966-b8b4-fc0c38660087"/>
    <XRef DateTime="20250719T225100" id="311bf653-30ed-4d65-a49b-1d9bc7012bab"/>
    <XRef DateTime="20251226T183821" id="bb93caa9-e934-4cda-aa07-9ccab99bcbbd"/>
  </DocumentRef>

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="67c8084b-dbe1-4043-9f21-275709f2a5ec">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Dirty City - Dawn</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7da9e7af-4fe3-43b2-b7c6-11301c202139">
      <Text>The gateway sign of </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Dirty City, Woodwork</Text>
      <Text> looms over the horizon. It reads: “The Cleanest City in the Garden Nation.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7da9e7af-4fe3-43b2-b7c6-11301c202139">
      <Text>Beyond the sign, </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">terracotta skyscrapers</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">ceramic pothouses</Text>
      <Text> crowd the streets. These are where residents root themselves.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="540a05c9-c339-4963-86ea-56a3f15793de">
      <Text>Parsley (v.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e6aa9584-b61b-4534-a4f2-45bf4cdf8dde">
      <Text>It’s dirt cheap in Dirty City in the country of Woodwork. Here, life is simple for the plants and bugs growing up on this soil.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="79e48cb9-1dcc-47cb-983c-57ed7a7b966f">
      <Text>A </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">plant citizen</Text>
      <Text> walks a </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">pet beetle</Text>
      <Text>. The beetle lifts a leg and pees on the "Cleanest" sign. A </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">beetle bug</Text>
      <Text Size="10"> </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">car</Text>
      <Text Size="10"> </Text>
      <Text>drives</Text>
      <Text Size="10"> </Text>
      <Text>past.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="d4c26f16-0367-4d0b-bb9e-91501c8f4676">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Beetle Car - Moments LATER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="af273816-5ad2-4532-81c6-e3bf5337b30a">
      <Text>The car stops at a redlight. To the right is </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text> salon.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d06c5d3e-b13d-4eb8-bc9f-fc1c4cd13fc5">
      <Text>Parsley (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="91a288dd-3ff0-4dd0-9853-d90ea1f8ee76">
      <Text>You get sun, you get water...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="98503d54-012e-4d53-80e4-eaa7c223bdf0">
      <SceneProperties Length="6/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text> - ConTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e06c34b5-16ff-473c-9631-ae99de97f833">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Parsley Ram</Text>
      <Text> (11), a sprout in brown overalls with bushy green hair and human-like limbs, twirls a broom.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9eaf09b9-dc9c-4bed-af78-9c9172fcb071">
      <Text>ParslEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="94a2c678-5421-4ff4-8b9c-d8855fc72ea0">
      <Text>...so long as your mom doesn’t rip your leaves off-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4f574c81-a147-4ec5-962c-a6420efe47eb">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Rau Ram</Text>
      <Text> (36), a cilantro with gleaming hair and a </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text> apron, steps out. Her voice is firm but her eyes are weary.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b9054db3-0d98-4d7d-ace7-21e2a16f4439">
      <Text>RaU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="00fa15ea-02b6-4358-a3cc-9b4dbed0799f">
      <Text>Parsley! You can talk to your imaginary friends once you finish sweeping </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text>. Pronto?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9049ffc8-1b4c-4fa3-8eed-2a164c75464e">
      <Text>Parsley droops his shoulder. Rau steps closer, placing her red hand (the mark of a transplant) on his green shoulder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a467d0f3-7ed0-4eb4-a3ed-4511c3e1e361">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="00fa15ea-02b6-4358-a3cc-9b4dbed0799f">
      <Text>Look at me. Out of both of us, </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">your</Text>
      <Text> roots came from this soil. You were naturally born with green leaves I am trying to earn. Don’t sweep that honor under the rug, my son.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2ac6f583-19b2-4711-9a74-94e6dbcf9688">
      <Text>Rau goes back inside. Parsley sighs, leaning on his broom.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b0da0f04-4fea-4090-9e2a-5ec32415a5bf">
      <Text>Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b75784c9-795f-49e0-8b03-f4dc5c722bb5">
      <Text>Love you, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Italic">má</Text>
      <Text Style="Italic"> (Viet: “Mom”)</Text>
      <Text>! Huh. Imaginary friends don’t judge roots or care if your leaves red or green-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="b9f9b72c-62dd-42b8-8f25-070402f36f20">
      <Text>Cut to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="7f4d36cb-fb9b-4b56-9404-1fb774d8fe99">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LION’S MANE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Parsley’s Imagination - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a8e6bcfb-e133-440c-a979-88b24833003d">
      <Text>Parsley sits at a toadstool table. The </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">moss-covered gnome</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Lion’s Mane</Text>
      <Text> sit opposite of him, like board of directors.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="eee3b738-a82f-4933-a9ec-25364c0fad52">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="df20b1c1-ffde-4fb7-a478-7108babc459f">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Italic">Má</Text>
      <Text Style="Italic"> (Viet: “Mom”) </Text>
      <Text>says I’m the one with the green hands. That I’m so lucky. But if I don’t grow tall enough to be seen... what is the point of being born here?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="37da8d6c-f292-4e9f-bd5f-d4ab22641b8d">
      <Text>Lion’s Mane</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="963573bc-a59c-4fc2-8a61-324a45f911d2">
      <Text>Worrying makes you bitter. Just be a trendy garnish. Sit on a plate and hope nobody’s got an appetite.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="bbac5683-0a2c-472b-b26f-884e358a2790">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Figleaf</Text>
      <Text> Nightclub - Continuous</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f4ff13bf-e466-4523-847e-a40e3f2a1d45">
      <Text>A window in the next-door nightclub opens, revealing </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Pyrus Crabapple</Text>
      <Text> (13), a pear in a tan hoodie. They see Parsley talk to himself. Pyrus looks at their </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">saxhorn</Text>
      <Text>, then back at him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="78fb4d8c-4638-4012-8be7-a40f2d9f07a9">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6d71bf04-43bc-428a-b228-250361d35388">
      <Text>Heck no to being a garnish! Full course is where it’s at!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="7f4d36cb-fb9b-4b56-9404-1fb774d8fe99">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MOSS GNOME">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Parsley’s Imagination - Continuous</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aab8a0c0-12c7-42c9-b2be-d0fe49fa2506">
      <Text>Moss Gnome</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bae23ece-5917-40d4-8561-2b7a9656638d">
      <Text>In this garden, you either bloom or end up a garnish for a creature’s salad. Don’t bloom. Blend in. Dirt is safe. Become one with the mulch-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="7cb90bf0-e2ee-4f97-aa4f-c3c65a7e9ca8">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 6/8" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BOMBUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="VERBENA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">SALONTRO</Text>
      <Text> / </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">FIGLEAF</Text>
      <Text> - ConTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2a9195cf-f017-414f-bf6a-49adba01f764">
      <Text>The Gnome’s face is replaced by Pyrus, blasting a saxhorn. Pyrus hides the instrument and climbs out of the window.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="34f24bab-7a4e-4045-b0ad-c8f6e7efaefe">
      <Text>PyRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6116886c-c4c6-421e-9983-e3726562b0a4">
      <Text>Holy moly. Your mom didn’t say you can’t talk to your real friend?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d9afc43b-961c-414f-b3d5-c4918b1f9ed9">
      <Text>ParSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d74b2bce-96b2-40ec-ad8c-8e256442b596">
      <Text>Pyrus! You </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">turnt</Text>
      <Text> my leaves white!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7207bd1e-7e96-47cc-a7a6-219a84cdf598">
      <Text>PyRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="86ba3a20-aae4-4785-b7a7-85eaf6205373">
      <Text>(to thin air)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f5f96b3c-5cf6-401a-81e8-28deafcf2a77">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Ope</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ope</Text>
      <Text>! Save your narrating for the sneezeworts. Germinations, nobody! I’m Pyrus Crabapple! Nibling of Malus, owner of </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">FigLeaf</Text>
      <Text> Nightclub. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text> neighbor. But mostly, this city knows Parsley and I make a great pair...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8fdfc8ab-0ac2-4832-9e54-9f1da21637bb">
      <Text>Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="eac3f833-0f50-47e3-919f-1bc17f30e148">
      <Text>...of trouble. You dirty pear. Been counting how many sweeps I got in?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b85c8535-0cc1-42ce-9fb1-930c3a78acbb">
      <Text>PyrUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="17aa6794-7d21-4fc3-9ee8-4ae77bfb55e1">
      <Text>Nah. Just watching that beetle. It ain’t moving from that redlight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fe78a7db-560a-4e7c-8f40-df58d74ed286">
      <Text>Parsley turns to see the beetle car under the stoplight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ac18b73e-ea48-44cb-b384-b39f1b463793">
      <Text>PyRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f5f18176-1245-4848-ab6d-40a01e1332d6">
      <Text>Let’s make ‘</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">em</Text>
      <Text> yellow. Oh Bombus!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="eb1377fc-740b-46ab-88e5-34a95c5c53a7">
      <Text>Rather than the side door of </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">FigLeaf</Text>
      <Text>, a </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">cat-sized pet bee</Text>
      <Text> named </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Bombus</Text>
      <Text>, smashes out of the side window.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1f19f45b-410a-4ade-b6e3-38ca942e6560">
      <Text>Bombus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fc4cb887-de64-439c-a22c-cf9b0ecc48b7">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Buzzzzzzzzzzzzz</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9dbf782d-03dd-46dd-a1de-9f6090474e9b">
      <Text>ParslEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b9cddc7b-d450-464a-8ef5-4ef0a9fb9796">
      <Text>You still </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gotta</Text>
      <Text> door-train the bee.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9ecd885d-355d-492c-9524-cb5faeecc3ec">
      <Text>Bombus flies and lands on the stoplight. They squeeze their body in the redlight and emit a yellow glow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a4b56e69-72cb-47c1-a578-37258cc9ac70">
      <Text>The beetle car moves and stops in front of </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text>. </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Verbena</Text>
      <Text> (20s) steps out, clutching a clipboard. She is a sleek, purple-petaled plant with the poise of a reality TV producer. She wears a sharp, leaf-fiber blazer and oversized shades.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="702a4a25-558d-421e-b5c2-d2e95336450d">
      <Text>Rau swiftly steps outside. She whispers to Parsley and Pyrus.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aa523dfa-2e28-4739-ba84-fc611c263226">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bef86cce-e19e-4b47-b12e-cc2aa99d112f">
      <Text>Parsley, hide our Bee’s Knees ointments. It’s not WDA-approved.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="630dedfd-0733-4321-896d-faf09c4f1428">
      <Text>(to Pyrus)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5fa038ed-5d3e-43d0-9de1-20d8647f474b">
      <Text>Don’t get us in trouble. </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Again</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ee4b051d-122d-493c-b060-7000d1f294fa">
      <Text>Parsley rushes inside </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text>. Pyrus follows and makes a loud crash inside. Rau shuts her eyes, trying to ignore it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="27235f44-ba0d-4d82-a140-68b9f71d6b9c">
      <Text>RaU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="360f5619-9992-431c-b074-79edbed38fc6">
      <Text>Welcome to </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text>. The finest salon in all of Woodwork-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f7ed78a9-cbcf-4eab-9c87-6301c61d4050">
      <Text>Verbena</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b21f301c-4dd9-4004-a28a-b9e075e7cdb8">
      <Text>Relax. I’m no inspector.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9a4c56c1-94ec-4f07-8677-2c522d660319">
      <Text>RaU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c52b2993-385b-49b1-a577-4778c7558255">
      <Text>Oh thank the higher farmer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="54cad692-7af5-446a-8282-7bd547517d96">
      <Text>VERBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b70d77ea-c082-4b07-b70d-600ecdf262a1">
      <Text>Verbena. Location scouting for </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text>-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="11a26b7b-c084-4e04-88ed-dfc6c8f0061c">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="86ba58c3-1993-4ded-b123-6fbff77d3b35">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text>... </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text> Mentha of-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0a587200-40d6-468d-babd-f2e0a4917c02">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">On screen</Text>
      <Text>: A bold "GET" logo, a green parody of the BET logo, with a leaf substituted for the star pops briefly behind Verbena with a drop of a hip-hop beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="162c2b75-3130-44a5-bea1-a31fd59f03cb">
      <Text>VerBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e5bef237-0cc4-49d7-84bd-61e1c7e7197c">
      <Text Style="Italic">Mint Condition</Text>
      <Text>, only on G E T.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="894c3366-bc6e-4d78-94e9-c59018c49a5c">
      <Text>Rau whips out a bunch of </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">DVD</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">VHS</Text>
      <Text> cases.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="202a854a-0d4f-480f-90d7-aab2571bf7ea">
      <Text>RaU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7976b536-b78e-45db-8be1-ceb3bd74c042">
      <Text>I have every season on Green-Ray, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">DVD</Text>
      <Text>, and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">VHS</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="bc176f6d-3d87-49bc-b94a-c6f80f2a0cda">
      <Text>SMASH CUT TO:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="7e9da245-b4f9-45a9-a333-f105162d0ca7">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="4" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LAMI">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TULIP">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Tv Screen - Mint Condition - 3 decades ago</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="46b5252e-25d7-46f3-a55e-d50a9022a1c1">
      <Text>Grainy, over-saturated footage. A mint plant, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="AllCaps">Lami</Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps"> Mentha</Text>
      <Text> (20s) and an unnamed </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">tulip</Text>
      <Text> are having a soap-opera moment.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cf249e34-cbd3-4141-9a8c-debed43b7fd0">
      <Text>Tulip</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="c93269cc-5ea3-4b13-a4fd-ce5b62b1d8a2">
      <Text>(Sobbing pollen)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5ca723a8-d717-42aa-ad06-5759e11ac547">
      <Text>You said we’d be perennial! But you’re just a single year! Are we not </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">mint</Text>
      <Text> to be?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f5f3de61-ba9e-4c7b-89f7-0134c7727ce4">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c7981104-3b29-4b53-b532-9ead56e8f273">
      <Text>Read my lips, you dumb Tulip!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="26c97f18-b2b6-4f51-b556-def6d7ec8f15">
      <Text>The Tulip gasps as a single petal falls in slow motion. Neon letters </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">slam</Text>
      <Text> onto the screen: </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">to be continued</Text>
      <Text>...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="eb9f885b-1fd7-4bd2-bea7-dc24d83d56ab">
      <Text>Rau (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="04921af2-9317-46da-85ab-4488185a4473">
      <Text>Missed the soap opera days before </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">Mint</Text>
      <Text Size="10"> </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">Condition</Text>
      <Text Size="10"> </Text>
      <Text>became</Text>
      <Text Size="10"> </Text>
      <Text>reality</Text>
      <Text Size="10"> </Text>
      <Text>shows-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="e604b356-1f11-47bb-966d-c0fbc27f16bf">
      <Text>Back to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="19373499-9dab-4fa0-a233-9b0adf9c5c2f">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="5" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="VERBENA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text> - Present</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7e838d7d-338f-4ae3-ad0d-d58c6e5dfd5b">
      <Text>Verbena stares at Rau, visibly weirded out by her fandom.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e78085d4-ed14-4556-abff-d2613993ad65">
      <Text>VERBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b70d77ea-c082-4b07-b70d-600ecdf262a1">
      <Text>...</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">VHS</Text>
      <Text>? </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Anywho</Text>
      <Text>, I wasn’t planning to make a stop here, but your bee helped get me out of the red.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6907b08f-a497-4920-8944-16a59396f4ff">
      <Text>RaU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0abf3cd8-610f-4bb0-babc-a0d6a2b42267">
      <Text>Bombus is the bee’s knees! Dirty City really needs to fix that red-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="698fa8b5-86ab-4744-8d49-02705dc7383d">
      <Text>VerBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2eec5bae-e028-4c93-bdd8-cfb264253f60">
      <Text>Stop! Not another word. I want to get my fix of your soil. Is it the diamond in the rough, seed in the dirt? Let’s see if your </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text> salon is truly in </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">Mint Condition</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="dc05621c-68bf-4150-88ca-5daeabcc0765">
      <SceneProperties Length="6/8" Page="5" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="VERBENA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">SALONTRO</Text>
      <Text> - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0ac61a77-bbd1-407e-be9f-cc1715a7b2d5">
      <Text>The salon is a blend of a Vietnamese spa and greenhouse. Vines frame the mirrors while mossy tanning beds lie about.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0ac61a77-bbd1-407e-be9f-cc1715a7b2d5">
      <Text>As Verbena's heels click while entering, Parsley frantically shoves honey-</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ish</Text>
      <Text> Bee’s Knees jars underneath the floorboards.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0cf307b2-a94a-405f-afe7-e4e5a0ee68cd">
      <Text>Pyrus is somehow tangled above in a hanging vine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fe5ff29f-fb8f-4953-9a1b-a2a8456a1927">
      <Text>Rau looks up in surprise. She shushes with her index finger.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="116d1a1d-3dd2-4310-bbc9-c5b40c09036e">
      <Text>RAU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="887312df-0da4-4383-8044-f11ce6f750d8">
      <Text>Shh... How...?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="33281082-eb16-4a05-92eb-b3dc45346569">
      <Text>VERBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="a4a980f3-72b0-4c31-8deb-1511bfe8ccda">
      <Text>(Unimpressed)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3ca115b9-5e1c-4670-97ed-1ae0adc497f0">
      <Text>How... earthy. A bit transplant-chic, isn't it? </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text> prefers something with prestige and safety.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="953ca0d9-e0f1-42a3-9530-f2c961ed52e6">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8a7cc110-40ac-4b4e-a25e-5d6286883626">
      <Text Style="Italic">Transplant</Text>
      <Text>...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="788e9d37-43f1-4ee6-8ae2-0a6477defe0f">
      <Text>Rau’s smile has enough pressure to crush a rock.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8c14361c-d460-4e81-b52d-cfec8326f965">
      <Text>RAU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="318810ce-167e-4e85-bc72-f658bb515c69">
      <Text>Madam Verbena, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text> is the green standard. We have never once had a soiled incident. We are the safest ecosystem in Dirty City!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="0b0f3a5c-21f6-4bad-b0da-da84de1e7a95">
      <Text>Cut to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="f3312c24-642d-4676-895c-1db4836e4ca0">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="6" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANDELION">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Flashback - A Week Ago</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d5eb41ac-d6f3-4177-9228-5f8c108bb14f">
      <Text>A </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Dandelion</Text>
      <Text> sits in the styling chair. Rau accidentally hits the turbo-mist button.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7e77ac7b-239e-459f-8a4e-477de594ffa8">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4513692e-c6a6-4aa0-b4c9-06e0ae63269e">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Ope</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4b83f9d0-788a-4b88-a789-fba7a2c9d9e2">
      <Text>The Dandelion suddenly </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">explodes</Text>
      <Text> into countless white seeds.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="93bb58ca-4369-46dd-b06c-9ec570e67931">
      <Text>DANDELION</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cae450f4-c993-4f85-ad23-fd4ec926b776">
      <Text>Keep... the... change!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="48fac6a1-1261-43ae-a81f-a055a385e800">
      <Text>The seeds fly everywhere, clogging the vents and triggering the fire alarm. Most drift out the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="bfa0b984-b190-454a-8fdd-a4a7a6fce730">
      <Text>Back to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="65dd6bda-ed3e-4fdd-80e7-e66118f792a5">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 5/8" Page="6" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY &amp; PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="VERBENA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text> - Present</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fc373002-62b5-44c9-9d0c-05ae023cd513">
      <Text>Rau is still smiling, as a single white dandelion seed drifts down and lands on her nose. She subtly sneezes it away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e5b3358e-26b3-4a47-92d4-a5a7c268c2e2">
      <Text>RAU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="54ed6ae6-9dd2-4dec-a673-d30c3cf30cb1">
      <Text>...safe as a-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fd70034f-8e54-47f2-ab15-efe406cca53c">
      <Text>Pyrus drops and lands face down next to Verbena. They get up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9b62a5d1-a389-4116-9d52-cb10946fa3ab">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="00c519ae-354c-44ec-9695-c5a8cf9137bc">
      <Text>What she means is, this place has soul. According to... uh... local legends...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4126dbc1-8854-458b-bdd7-b7b6ec6e15c9">
      <Text>Pyrus pulls the </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Furrow Bark journal</Text>
      <Text> from their hoodie, hiding it from Rau and Verbena but showing Parsley.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0b8ac499-81d1-4ac3-8811-190946708c1b">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b1d2a8cf-5e30-4a75-814f-0250c31ed587">
      <Text>This book says this salon is built on a spiritual sap-line. If we crank the misting system all the way up, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text> will glow so bright she’ll be visible from Woody Holly!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2a1665ff-e355-494c-a1c1-c88145a61aae">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e800509c-b0bf-4dd7-bac7-dafe016df743">
      <Text>Pyrus! That’s my mom’s journal! She keeps it under her bed! How’d-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="db197d8f-5e6c-48eb-886d-7ef8c6caf2b5">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f03318d9-20dd-4868-b03d-e5d3aa67131d">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Ope</Text>
      <Text>! I might’ve "borrowed" it while she was waiting at the redlight. It looked like a cookbook, but it’s full of weird science.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="86970365-93b9-4765-bd24-d078e54603aa">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0674eccc-5b23-4018-b434-68fa4e679906">
      <Text>The only thing more dangerous than a bad idea is...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.50" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="dfd1bdc1-fd22-4967-abf4-b76acb51107b">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4f3bfc15-9990-4a6c-985b-06bc5bed28cd">
          <Text>ParSLEY</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8eb757fa-a72b-426f-b4e0-9fbb7d3fe61b">
          <Text>...a weirdo.</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="80be1b4e-8826-461f-a97b-8ecb7d0defdc">
          <Text>PyRUS</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0674eccc-5b23-4018-b434-68fa4e679906">
          <Text>Boredom.</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4d9bfe43-f956-4b51-968a-0ef65a9bf0cf">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6e21c352-9b2d-4fea-a1a7-2b4aa076372e">
      <Text>Wait until you see the lighting, Verbena! It’s... condition-breaking-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="83d1751b-2370-4e41-bc0b-849ed9489e75">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="34af1a32-c8ac-4012-adab-7aa5587277f8">
      <Text>Don’t you dare.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c6a48125-7d2f-4ce7-a655-bf9fbfd8f2d8">
      <Text>VERBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="640f030b-5cf5-4253-83a6-a3a6a5157907">
      <Text>Bold words for a garnish. Show me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ff16d0e0-ae69-4db2-b741-67d924e89986">
      <Text>Pyrus grabs a lever on the wall labeled: “</Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Do not touch. That means you, Pyrus</Text>
      <Text>.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="af599098-cb1e-44de-a508-7a24220aef28">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7b25e9df-db66-45cc-8d55-c09f3fd5e069">
      <Text>What does it say - Oh can’t read-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e5ea1c34-6f34-4b48-be22-820a818fe210">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">The music kicks in</Text>
      <Text>: Rocky Vietnamese. Pyrus slams the lever.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e9f1eabf-2886-4d9f-b01e-f01c936bf674">
      <Text>Pyrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6a0ed99e-2239-444b-bcb2-a00ff711ec2c">
      <Text>The "Cleanest City in Woodwork" is about to get real messy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="97490527-5148-4d12-958b-776c538fd0c0">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Whoosh</Text>
      <Text>! A blast of emerald light and herbal mist explodes from the vents. Verbena’s purple hair turns neon green.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="97490527-5148-4d12-958b-776c538fd0c0">
      <Text>Parsley and Pyrus look at each other, horrified and thrilled.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4c535426-d9b7-497c-ac74-d058f0bd651c">
      <Text>PyrUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="68f45139-7a86-42bf-b8dd-df483708d3d3">
      <Text>Quick, let’s capture this moment on the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text> cam!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="65fd7c72-3a7a-41e3-a644-74ab59c073fd">
      <Text>Pyrus grabs the leaf-shaped camera.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="54e9f1a3-17d3-47cc-97f4-d07418260a15">
      <Text>Parsley &amp; PYrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9746e541-cee3-463d-89ee-ed0e3f9a19fe">
      <Text>Photosynthesis... photosynthesis... Photo!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="34082415-f846-429a-9488-855007a29a6b">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Flash</Text>
      <Text>. The image captures Verbena looking shocked, Rau ready to faint, and the two kids giving thumbs up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="10acbef3-c032-4ddb-ba03-fba85821dd4d">
      <SceneProperties Length="2" Page="7" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="VERBENA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">SALONTRO</Text>
      <Text> - Moments Later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2e1f1502-0800-447a-a3e2-2d93e191dc19">
      <Text>The emerald haze thins, revealing Verbena standing like a statue. Her hair pulses neon green. She seems mesmerized.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="45c02ebf-dda6-48b2-8bd6-fd7a09743895">
      <Text>Rau frantically fans the air with a carpet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="144c30e4-cf45-4c89-8717-9a5ec7dfc756">
      <Text>RAU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="37c78cdb-9612-4f0e-b907-d7329c3d1517">
      <Text>I’m so sorry! The wiring here is... Well, it’s literally vines! I can fix this, Verbena, I have a de-oxidizing rinse in the back—</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3e81d74a-d45c-4242-860d-112e505b8234">
      <Text>VERBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0b13a4e7-6da9-4728-956f-928b665fb244">
      <Text>Don’t you dare touch it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="20b3743f-9cef-411f-8ddc-29a69f0eb2bf">
      <Text>Rau freezes, mid-fan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6fe2bf95-fd05-4020-96b5-4bfdf9248910">
      <Text>RAU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="3331411f-fd4c-4ea7-abe1-6c8e34018737">
      <Text>(in Vietnamese; subtitled)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="eeb1361d-4a1e-44a0-8b41-d9459dec3458">
      <Text>...</Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">Xin </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Italic">loi</Text>
      <Text>?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="b263cb1d-5b43-4e01-9e05-20f3aa2e8870">
      <Text>(Sorry?)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b602f6dc-8671-48c7-8dca-13fd3e552ceb">
      <Text>VERBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5ac78df2-91a2-4842-b069-1b02bec16d4a">
      <Text>The luminosity... saturation... it’s like looking at a forest fire. It’s exactly the look </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text> Mentha needs to reboot her image.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3af78aaf-02c0-42ae-a42f-44c1c2e56b1e">
      <Text>Rau snaps out of her shock. Her eyes dart from Verbena to the "</Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Do Not Touch</Text>
      <Text>" lever, then back to the kids. She sees the opportunity of a lifetime. She smooths her apron and strikes a pose, pretending the chaos was choreography.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0595761c-2be1-415a-83d6-cf8ab3fc2d16">
      <Text>RAU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="044f0e79-224f-4892-8b09-7ddd369df541">
      <Text>Exactly! You’ve just experienced... The Greenlight</Text>
      <Text Font="Sans Devanagari Final Draft">! </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro’s</Text>
      <Text> exclusive, </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">patent-pending</Text>
      <Text>, deep-tissue </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Heliophyte</Text>
      <Text> Highlights!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="96d91b57-2f3b-485a-ae49-0be03c5dbc3d">
      <Text>Verbena is transfixed by her glowing leafy hands.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3a90365a-3ac5-453d-b94b-a9c94b5661fb">
      <Text>VERBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b5a2f91b-8f89-4ebd-bf09-e4c291847888">
      <Text Style="Italic">Greenlight Highlights</Text>
      <Text>. As producer, green and light sound expensive.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="59fe4bd4-901c-457c-ba89-b9ac8376c629">
      <Text>RAU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a84a4d32-229a-4aa8-89c7-b00170fc51e5">
      <Text>Oh, it’s premium! It um... uses Paddy-sap to revitalize the chlorophylls! It’s the diamond in the rough you’ve been looking for.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fc76d733-3baf-407d-94af-58f2ef513450">
      <Text>Rau shoots a look at Pyrus that says "I’ll</Text>
      <Text Size="10"> </Text>
      <Text>compost</Text>
      <Text Size="10"> </Text>
      <Text>you</Text>
      <Text Size="10"> </Text>
      <Text>later.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="813c77bf-34e1-4e0e-85b4-870947c70fdc">
      <Text>RAU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2059570a-8f42-4887-8013-4fa2056b6072">
      <Text>But it’s such a delicate process. So high maintenance. It requires total environmental control.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bdb5b488-853e-4823-9774-9d7f32f8d47e">
      <Text>Verbena swiftly writes on her clipboard.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="594d8d2d-ff74-4e7e-85a6-2ef4b29c6eae">
      <Text>VERBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bd9bb823-744d-4959-80cb-2d960da12a6c">
      <Text>Fab. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text> loves high maintenance. I want the full Greenlight highlights for her. The mist, </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">neon diamond</Text>
      <Text>. Don't change a single molecule.
</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d2b3c942-0c04-496f-b29b-332ffeab6d11">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text> arrives tomorrow. If you can recreate this Greenlight highlights for the cameras, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text> will be the lead feature of the new season.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e0290709-7442-40ce-b39f-f686438f713b">
      <Text>RAU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9a2594fd-c199-4fb8-8275-74b9069a4e49">
      <Text>Tomorrow? The mulch isn’t ready!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="90cb62ae-83b9-4747-8853-6d580088423f">
      <Text>VERBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="42c1a02b-14b9-4efd-a84c-d194f7431b24">
      <Text>Keep the mulch dirty, transplant. It’s </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">authentic</Text>
      <Text>. Be in touch!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8aa93e74-faf4-485f-a2be-bed5d85c3b07">
      <Text>Verbena exits with her heels clicking. Rau sinks in a chair. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6a331542-6536-4f26-a4db-5b3ba8e5e2df">
      <Text>Parsley grabs the grinning Pyrus by the hoodie.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d6cec675-97cf-476f-b806-4c30fffbf350">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6a99488d-b0d4-439d-9f78-165c10423d86">
      <Text>See? I told you, we’re gonna be on Green-Ray... and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Italic">VH-DVD</Text>
      <Text Style="Italic"> what</Text>
      <Text>?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2e5312c1-58a4-4b00-b103-b2bd3b3bbbc8">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="700b14a4-b7e6-4085-8eba-1dcd9f658655">
      <Text>Pyrus, we aren't geniuses. Look!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bf1df3a0-dfaf-4d70-8792-3a9141bce54c">
      <Text>Parsley points to the journal still open on the floor. He points to a warning written in red ink at the bottom.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3c613a42-24d6-4d78-a80f-e2028d23e4a2">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1bb72eef-bc39-4fcc-887c-fa4a923311bf">
      <Text>Warning: Photosynthesis of high-maintenance plants, such as mints, may cause total cellular implosion.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3a76b960-dcf7-4bfe-835d-492bd0d57e30">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ca5822ea-437e-46b2-ba4b-c04365bc6e08">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Ope</Text>
      <Text>. The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">paparazzis</Text>
      <Text>...?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="716e8605-5903-40ae-9494-dac8b2e3eb73">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ba513203-84a9-4c11-a07e-79b8abe4a627">
      <Text>If </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text> Mentha wilts on national TV because we over-cooked her...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="b49cd9f0-e985-4cc2-99a7-89405aa30915">
      <Text>SMASH CUT TO:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="6749c1e4-d0e4-43eb-bac9-dbb0059c9c49">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="9" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LAMI">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Woody HOlly Red Carpet - Imagination</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="558f4d00-3e24-4932-bc86-73662f0a858c">
      <Text>The paparazzi (literal </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">fireflies</Text>
      <Text> with flashing cameras) swarm </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="AllCaps">Lami</Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps"> Mentha</Text>
      <Text> (50s). She strikes a pose, but her emerald glow suddenly turns a sickly brown. With a sound like a deflating balloon, she collapses into a pile of dried mint leaves.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="59147c18-3675-4ebb-aa24-58e681367fff">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="300c80f3-c9c1-48d5-838c-ec35971b43bb">
      <Text>Call... my... publicist...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1921ae28-6b90-43b2-baee-375c59513364">
      <Text>A fancy </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Bonsai</Text>
      <Text> accidentally steps on her, turning</Text>
      <Text Size="10"> </Text>
      <Text>her</Text>
      <Text Size="10"> </Text>
      <Text>to</Text>
      <Text Size="10"> </Text>
      <Text>dust.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="d10dad08-833d-450c-8adc-2f9dd8f55221">
      <Text>BACK TO:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="87b5e9a9-6c71-4847-a36f-aa9af115a6ad">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="10" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY &amp; PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text> - Present</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="80c6ca38-4e36-48af-90c0-76c15d8787ff">
      <Text>Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1df9cb55-1ba0-4aa2-9ec6-effe91744a85">
      <Text>...we’ll all turn into potpourri.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fa282603-b2cf-4a39-9999-1263562f6ea6">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">On screen: A photo of Potpourri</Text>
      <Text>. A photo of colorful, dried potpourri mix (pinecones, herbs, and dried flowers) pops up right next to Parsley's face, with a popping sound effect.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="55aa205c-7a94-499b-9e95-277e8d17ea97">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="be4b691a-da19-49e0-919e-b234df2156b2">
      <Text>Not only did we book mom a TV deal but a seat to the end of the world.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a8ed2e67-15dc-468d-8f2a-6bb8095c5cc0">
      <Text>Pyrus grabs their leaf-shaped phone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="64b2becd-dc0b-4c13-9b27-16c254e2dea6">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0776d6bd-1a17-4fda-aad5-dc6bc9b2f63a">
      <Text>The classic Parsley-Pyrus special: one part dream, two parts doom. If we're going down, might as well document the evidence!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bb59cc0c-024d-418d-a8f1-69f85b3853ae">
      <Text>Parsley &amp; Pyrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="c1fe862a-4ade-427a-9789-f34df6d3e038">
      <Text>(Shaky)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ff165f46-1efa-40f6-9e1e-4e809e5d0ecb">
      <Text>Photosynthesis... photosynthesis... Photo...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3e7a6b89-6a7a-461c-8914-9869a25cba43">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Flash</Text>
      <Text>. The image captures Parsley in pure dread while Pyrus gives a thumbs up that looks more like a cry for help.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="8b067831-7abb-4168-add0-977662f8e2bc">
      <SceneProperties Length="1" Page="10" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MALUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Figleaf</Text>
      <Text> - Night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0ab7ff2f-8f5c-4fde-9d66-7820c58419a6">
      <Text>The nightclub bops ultraviolet lights next to the dark salon. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0ab7ff2f-8f5c-4fde-9d66-7820c58419a6">
      <Text>Several big </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">fireflies</Text>
      <Text> flicker. Bombus chases them about.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0ab7ff2f-8f5c-4fde-9d66-7820c58419a6">
      <Text>A red apple and nightclub owner named </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Malus Crabapple</Text>
      <Text> (50s) sits on a crate out front, nursing a bottle of sap.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8b2dad0a-be1f-4934-bbe1-fae3d223ca02">
      <Text>Pyrus approaches their </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">unty</Text>
      <Text> Malus. Parsley is alongside them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1649d67b-26c7-4bc6-af22-e9cfd62d5263">
      <Text>MALUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="92302555-1a37-43ee-bc1d-b5dacd40f154">
      <Text>Heard the news, sprouts. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text>? What a diva. She’s got enough ego to shade an entire forest. Why’s a mint like her coming to Dirty City?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0e9cd885-9e1c-446a-a9f7-b1c31d20a298">
      <Text>PyRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="74f396e4-bbd9-4244-bfb3-cb0c74ef9d70">
      <Text>A location scout chose </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text>, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">unty</Text>
      <Text> Malus.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="95015291-1597-419b-8579-5c7177b324c4">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3eb4d237-f6a7-4bc4-a31c-3ffbfb0e1c95">
      <Text>She said we’ve got soul!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="609e2ef2-7ee8-48e7-ac3f-676198c72403">
      <Text>MALUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="13483621-6fe5-4895-9e3b-b4a1b64c8019">
      <Text>Scouts don't choose soul. They calculate. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text> ain’t just a singer. She is an enlister. She finds the brightest plants, and suddenly they ain’t the neighborhood no more. They ain’t touching my </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">FigLeaf</Text>
      <Text> that’s </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">fosure</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d679b41e-82c6-4091-8fbf-ce2f231eadc1">
      <Text>Bombus lands on Parsley’s head, buzzing a mournful tune that sounds suspiciously like a funeral march.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="45f1fa34-a6ea-4aed-9f15-3e7308eb2b3a">
      <Text>Malus heads inside </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">FigLeaf</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dfdeca51-fb6c-4bb1-8a15-2c0d591affe3">
      <Text>Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="402f33b5-d7b4-4da1-bacf-96faf8b5b6e9">
      <Text>The Greenlight feels a lot more like a stoplight...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e28f6b9c-f2ac-45e0-a3fa-d8d47a2fd9b5">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="31585d30-69dd-41cb-bbdd-c98ff02a0afc">
      <Text>Don't listen to </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Unty</Text>
      <Text> Malus. They’re just sour grapes. Or sour apples. Tomorrow, everything will be sweet!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="114bc8a2-5211-45eb-98c8-cae6250dc598">
      <Text>Bombus becomes uplifting.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="87f8d09f-7016-4329-ae1c-3b27e3bf3ffb">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 1/8" Page="11" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY &amp; PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text> - MomeNTS LATER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2c5663df-283c-4f3a-a32a-d7be5a02f053">
      <Text>Rau is pacing, clutching a bottle of "Evergreen Shine."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d31d5e86-bad9-4bdb-91e4-62afc03348a3">
      <Text>RAU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="194d066f-988c-4672-a939-3341550c92d6">
      <Text>Tomorrow. Tomorrow! I have to prepare the Paddy Kingdom infusion. If I can just get </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text> to endorse my "Cilantro Calm" serum, we can afford to move to Woody Holly!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="62480ea4-02e6-46e6-b528-28469ed1ecf7">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1091eaa0-d253-4901-9e8d-c363724fdf66">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Italic">Má</Text>
      <Text Style="Italic"> (Viet: “Mom”)</Text>
      <Text>, maybe we should just stick to the regular lights? Ones that don’t smell like ozone?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e0225e14-6db5-4d0f-96f8-5de64e9953ec">
      <Text>RAU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c88955c2-7bcf-47ae-bace-8db316223e1e">
      <Text>Son, look at this place. We’ve worked so hard. This is our chance to finally bloom where we’re planted. Don't worry. Your mother knows what she’s doing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e0567f87-59ac-4d3d-85cf-74d04868b806">
      <Text>Rau heads off to bed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="de2cf30b-b601-42a6-ac70-386b95af2e19">
      <Text>Parsley gets out the Journal and flips through until they find the page.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="70c7ef13-8618-4197-9537-3b12d555c3db">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a207ea63-06d4-4a34-887a-f8c55b9723c6">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">How to stop total cellular implosion</Text>
      <Text>. Step one: Find a Moon Fungus. Step two: Don’t get caught.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d01c4f8a-2b08-4af6-b2a0-fccbdf4f6342">
      <Text>Pyrus and Bombus pop their heads through the back window.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d5b7d081-c1b6-4ccc-9847-fe943ee0ffd6">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9afc16d3-33d4-42dc-8151-847f86c43b3a">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Psst</Text>
      <Text>. Lil herb. Want to go on a midnight garden raid?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="254aa521-a6c7-4641-922c-d3f2fc38acf1">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="9929af47-8367-41e8-8351-d1459235c5fa">
      <Text>(Sighing)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d6ba0c7d-6c46-4656-922d-ce973b607866">
      <Text>Step two is optional...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1fd2c833-c7ca-48ca-a3d5-70550163205f">
      <Text>Parsley joins Pyrus by the window.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="007046b2-8ae5-4804-be5e-66ee0f19fff3">
      <Text>Parsley &amp; Pyrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="a5c4ebe3-3f53-4df7-a055-2c6352815f0e">
      <Text>(Quietly)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ca49e049-be52-4ed5-9dea-e58159ae7540">
      <Text>Photosynthesis... photosynthesis...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c8a40107-037c-417b-ab81-2ff267c7ef6d">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="75b7c534-728e-4f26-9502-9c04f5637af6">
      <Text>Photo.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6c47273f-985c-4b6b-82c0-d70cccaa049f">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Flash</Text>
      <Text>. The image captures Parsley climbing out the back window with Pyrus.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="aec2808c-4d9b-4de9-a43f-4fd9a2f2a01e">
      <SceneProperties Length="4 5/8" Page="12" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BOMBUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY &amp; PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="THUJA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. WOODWORK NATIONAL PARK - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4dffca1a-b9f5-41fd-849d-5f165382bdb4">
      <Text>A dense fog clings to the forest grounds. Giant mushrooms tower overhead like umbrellas. Parsley and Pyrus are trekking through the underbrush, with Bombus holding a flashlight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="eda8f496-13fe-4d04-b851-e355bab1b789">
      <Text>ParSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="390d19e2-6e39-4b53-a6fd-25dd0c09242a">
      <Text>I thought Bombus was a bumblebee...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cd8ec6d9-223e-48a8-b563-a85505ef9290">
      <Text>PyRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dc7e9509-1fc2-4494-93f8-097cbbb76aea">
      <Text>Bombus is whatever they wanna be.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7298ddd4-dc97-43fe-b592-ec51e2dc6893">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4ea3717d-3a22-4c1b-afea-48923cf28ab4">
      <Text>The Journal says the Moon Fungus is found only in the shady acres. It’s the one thing strong enough to keep a plant from wilting under heavy photosynthesis. It also glows green when it’s ripe. See any light- Ah!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="618e667a-b79e-4012-af3a-9ed7aaaf66cf">
      <Text>Holding a flashlight underneath, Pyrus makes a scary face, startling Parsley.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="04891a80-07e9-4e19-b746-cc970fe075e9">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="de85d6e7-3d3a-4f78-b0e7-bbee07fbf2d6">
      <Text>I am the light.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8062edff-2602-4141-8f22-7dc097bccde0">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="99651b80-989d-4f2c-8018-e4db17060652">
      <Text>Knock it off. You’re scary enough under sunlight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6a1812f0-dea5-4d99-85a8-be2f93b417ff">
      <Text>PyRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ec06e1bc-a9cf-40c7-92c7-8d7b59050032">
      <Text>Say that again and I’ll have Bombus fire you into the sun.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6e636c27-6f16-477e-b760-00b58e8b227d">
      <Text>Bombus flies off to a circle of glowing mushrooms.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8166c11e-0643-4d24-91f3-f26498e47958">
      <Text>BomBUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="cd1fecbb-7bc8-4d07-83df-38bf4068f332">
      <Text>(Staccato)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="09703dd1-4815-4efa-aeb9-39268f8c42d5">
      <Text>Buzz!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="54c1fc42-dd6e-49d8-ba36-89e20c21e052">
      <Text>PyRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ef853cf3-bf6a-49ff-84e6-3804ecd8b8c7">
      <Text>There goes Bombus, at it again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3a28a48b-bdaf-4c88-8f19-1f4f8f8879b8">
      <Text>An elegant Moon Fungus blooms in the center of a circle of glowing mushrooms. It pulses like a heartbeat. The gills shimmer with a haunting, cosmic green.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d407d0c3-6cfc-45c6-a53e-266dd674fcfe">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="77149f4e-9f8b-4c18-9af5-8960692b53a1">
      <Text>(Gasping)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="76d523b4-7254-487e-a4ea-8ce72fd7b16f">
      <Text>The Moon Fungus.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a79b4c04-09f9-47bd-8bda-2b09866ef0a3">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9b7b80a0-9e16-460a-957c-ae4de303c68c">
      <Text>Easy </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">peasy</Text>
      <Text>, lemon-squeezy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e90a4d19-a8c3-4b21-bb6d-bed9a12a36c3">
      <Text>A few </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">pine cones</Text>
      <Text> drop near Parsley and Pyrus.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="25f2e94e-9847-4bbf-b144-45235ad363c0">
      <Text>PyRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f39ec170-25f9-4f1b-9b50-4ccdd946344b">
      <Text>Pine cones?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1f0c50fc-ee3f-47c4-b4f7-aec4ee18f9de">
      <Text>THUJA (O.S.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7964e5ba-262c-4a5a-b9d9-6a40c975a219">
      <Text>I wouldn’t squeeze that if I were you, scouts!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b8d1ca44-6d59-4428-9356-fa96ef790b01">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Park Ranger Thuja Carpenter</Text>
      <Text> (40s) DROP from above, landing with a ground-shaking </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">thud</Text>
      <Text>. They are a massive pine tree with an ornament eye patch. They hold a rake like a trident.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="147b3282-8172-4422-bb81-94f3ec37e0b0">
      <Text>The Moon Fungus’s pulse skips a beat and changes color from green to yellow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aa3022d8-9395-4532-b0e6-07894bdb6fb8">
      <Text>ParSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="74705d56-393c-4cbd-abc7-7a95dee22a89">
      <Text>Did it just turn yellow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e53ef38b-47d4-4d10-adab-23d947c3fefc">
      <Text>PyRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3772996f-e4fa-43da-9a37-2a8d9d42dbb2">
      <Text>You owe me a fertilizer popsicle if it turns red.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3ee0e848-1e1b-494d-887b-46f205d82c88">
      <Text>The Moon Fungus changes from yellow to red.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9c342be9-f934-4a50-8a07-d8584b065de4">
      <Text>PyRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7defc3c5-f560-44ad-a009-1a605aa34765">
      <Text>You owe me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2aaf8ace-e48d-4aa7-9cfd-4095f0c0c127">
      <Text>ParSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f577e4c0-5104-430f-8b98-d44dad92bd74">
      <Text>I didn’t agree to anything...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6486ea99-d937-48b7-812d-509fc721bb36">
      <Text>ThuJA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ab839e7a-27a4-47a5-be9f-08bac35ed58a">
      <Text>You didn’t agree to the closed sign either. The fungi here got feelings. You stress it out, it stops being medicine and starts being a landmine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0eade282-239d-497f-af5b-79917374238e">
      <Text>ParSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c8de56c7-b47e-4439-ad97-85d84692dddb">
      <Text>They need therapy like you, Pyrus.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="07d33077-a2b1-4f45-ae5d-0f946d981d3c">
      <Text>THUJA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0b4bbf0f-9db3-4b1d-a90f-b740075001ff">
      <Text>You city kids are like aphids. You show up, suck the life out of the park, and leave a sticky mess.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2f2c38af-e85b-4150-ae05-e08e07b51a4a">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c0969f6b-e2a8-49a5-a478-7be53eacdf0b">
      <Text>Wow. What a grumpy Christmas tree.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dd6f6ae5-122e-4446-bef5-c4056d61a67a">
      <Text>THUJA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="2e0b1f1f-4955-4f14-a443-8f44a94a4d57">
      <Text>(Eye patch twitching)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ca140e78-3667-4e48-8647-6d94b2fe9e5a">
      <Text>I’m not </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">ornament</Text>
      <Text> to be a Christmas tree! You want to spend the night in a compost bin?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d422341f-bb31-4988-bd78-74f039515643">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5a3291f5-513c-4e0a-913a-5e03497e61c1">
      <Text>Ranger! We’re... We’re just on a... midnight biology field trip?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6b849944-0698-471b-8aab-3250c4ffdaa3">
      <Text>Thuja</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="54884c18-77c1-4573-b963-906bda6febf6">
      <Text>(Squinting)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="61691af8-efce-4933-99aa-5ba667aebce0">
      <Text>Midnight biology? At two in the morning? In a restricted growth zone? You kids from Dirty City think the rules are just "suggestions," don't you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="da922155-7261-40d8-addf-6195e6706dcd">
      <Text>PyRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="85de662d-0ed9-49d9-ad32-d35d387bfa28">
      <Text>Look, Ranger, we’re on a mission of mercy! If we don't get that fungus, a major celebrity is going to turn into a raisin on national TV!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="63fe1cbd-3ab3-419d-9a14-74302a26f3b8">
      <Text>Thuja</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="8b210430-5da7-4133-84c3-13efc37a2eab">
      <Text>(Chuckling)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="156473ea-d325-4af2-bc86-759c289e80fa">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text> Mentha? I heard she was coming. That plant wouldn't know real nature if it bit her on the stamen. But the Moon Fungus is endangered. You can't just pick it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="68e22fc2-d3ca-4ef6-abb9-b262eb811168">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Music Cues: Fast-paced Bluegrass/folk fusion</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="356e865d-6518-4198-90ec-4755d43a38b2">
      <Text>Bombus buzzes to the bass of the music.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4d7dccb9-13b7-4718-bb38-80a36f40d533">
      <Text>BoMBUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="40212d4d-86c6-4fff-9562-c7b46de950d3">
      <Text>Buzz. Buzz. Buzz. Buzz.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7cc2ae37-19cf-47d3-804c-91c03599d043">
      <Text>PyRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e1a162da-706b-4336-ab4d-201ca9484003">
      <Text>The bass is a cue for... Run, lil herb!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3ee0e848-1e1b-494d-887b-46f205d82c88">
      <Text>The Moon Fungus changes from red to green.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="68e22fc2-d3ca-4ef6-abb9-b262eb811168">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">The chase begins</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d1f18d35-c1e8-47db-b174-b32b7af1b2cc">
      <Text>Thuja swings their rake. Parsley and Pyrus </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">duck</Text>
      <Text> and weave. Thuja smashes the ground and it </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">explodes</Text>
      <Text> into mulch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f233eb03-a0c2-4b4b-a66c-bbd105d02c6d">
      <Text>Parsley runs in zig-zags.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="788cbbb3-3267-4f61-8661-a23fef2342d9">
      <Text>ParSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5ba0b518-e5bc-4082-88ac-e189f91827a1">
      <Text>Journal! What does it say about angry pines?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4b2c0092-42ce-4c3c-8e62-f9a91d117274">
      <Text>Pyrus does a parkour flip over a mushroom.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3df0c356-7f71-4ec1-816c-0b9696acda59">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ca7170ae-2830-4ac4-936a-b39a571f13d4">
      <Text>The Journal doesn’t cover "Aggressive Horticulture"! But a bumblebee sting always works!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1387651f-4ed8-4082-86df-52224509936a">
      <Text>Thuja vaults over a giant mushroom.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="57f14a92-1618-47aa-9873-ca05a31b1305">
      <Text>THUJA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8a3358ff-fd60-4f0d-997d-eddd28869cbd">
      <Text>I told that Gardener not to leave this book lying around! You kids are a menace to the ecosystem!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="733c26ea-fb0c-4bf4-9a46-4c4cda661ef7">
      <Text>Bombus performs a dizzying loop around Thuja’s head. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b14a3a34-e2a7-4d90-8217-abf5c461c18b">
      <Text>THUJA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a057ff23-61e9-4e78-8a94-99ac203902bf">
      <Text>Get off me, you oversized gnat! I can't think straight!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="733c26ea-fb0c-4bf4-9a46-4c4cda661ef7">
      <Text>Bombus squirts a stream of honey-ink onto Thuja’s eye.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ce01aece-b5f8-4bb7-9a72-c7e79bb17b38">
      <Text>THUJA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="32bc42f6-90da-4565-8bc7-30870927aae0">
      <Text>My vision! Delicious... but blurry!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b6a7c0d9-0b23-4435-87df-60cf781668b3">
      <Text>Bombus lands a "sting” (they write a glowing insult in honey-ink on the ground: “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">YER</Text>
      <Text> MOM’S A SPRUCE-GOOSE!”)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9ea13124-1793-4d52-ad40-ee7414027f95">
      <Text>Thuja stops, trying to read the insult.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="970070d5-c374-4aa0-a914-736e091d481e">
      <Text>THUJA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4f1f2faa-e57d-4ce4-b136-4e52ba61ca38">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Yer</Text>
      <Text> mom’s a spruce-goose?! That's uncalled for! My mother was a lovely hemlock!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4efda21a-ff4f-4142-8df1-0bb8de175cda">
      <Text>Parsley steps forward in earnest.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f005935d-75ff-4106-9359-0749eba9ee77">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0f328ca3-7e1a-406a-b7b8-d88c8febe2dd">
      <Text>Ranger, please! We’re not vandals! We’re just... we’re just kids trying to keep a salon from exploding!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="061562da-720f-4f63-93d1-cc46005fa3cf">
      <Text>ThUJA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="85e47a97-bd1a-4fe1-ac0f-7d5a5e3c7f69">
      <Text>A classic tale of kids coming together to save... a salon?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="65941092-d351-46fb-90f9-30d370ebfe47">
      <Text>PyRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8bf5e8e8-bb11-4043-a484-f347a43f9913">
      <Text>From exploding!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f2f7930e-5eeb-4d4b-ade3-2566d83666fb">
      <Text>Thuja looks at the journal in Parsley’s hand, then at the glowing green dust on Bombus. They sigh, lowering their rake.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f222ce29-e1ed-42dc-b132-b6a545c1c40b">
      <Text>ThUJA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3a6352c9-87e8-43f0-b33f-ecd90d9632e0">
      <Text>That book. Only one plant ever had the guts to write down the secrets of the soil. Aren’t you the cilantro’s kid?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4a8e6255-f2d2-45f2-bf4b-4cad8b00e937">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="73b6af45-9c57-4649-9ae8-7f24f21a9be4">
      <Text>Yes. And I’m not gonna let my mom’s dream wilt because I was too scared to face a pine tree.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="300903b3-af41-4ea8-b9d6-82ee35a22016">
      <Text>THUJA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8b2e59f6-840e-404f-858a-d53061b679c6">
      <Text>Fine. If I catch you back here again, you both will be sawdust.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fdfe1d8b-bd71-47fa-956f-e6f3226cc7ad">
      <Text>Pyrus nudges Parsley.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dddd2cb9-17d1-4efc-968d-ab83214aedf7">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e4052545-ef95-46b5-8e66-eec86e217b47">
      <Text>See? Everyone loves a garnish.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fbcc8f92-293d-4697-8237-20a53a7fdd46">
      <Text>Bombus flies to the Moon Fungus and gently rolls in the petals, coming away covered in glowing green dust.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5cdd5b5c-3e6b-4aaa-b5b9-182103822024">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="38e2eb8e-f7eb-40fe-af2b-326ddf356829">
      <Text>(Holding up the phone)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="639c4c1a-5f1e-49b4-b725-be262e3259cb">
      <Text>Ranger! Smile for the fans!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="84a63505-2288-4079-8dd4-b83af6ff09c8">
      <Text>Parsley &amp; Pyrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d2ca9a60-5b00-4914-9f40-8dfedce4bbde">
      <Text>Photosynthesis... photosynthesis...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1d5c7bdf-f8ea-4d21-b1b7-4b778a13ff59">
      <Text>Thuja</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="25464b38-8ec0-4765-83b0-f099e4b54059">
      <Text>Photo!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b10deeda-c743-4037-ac85-5b9f955e8a94">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Flash</Text>
      <Text>. The image captures Thuja poking their rake at Pyrus’s hair and Parsley celebrating with a glowing green Bombus.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="9c28da45-bf15-4930-b366-d69f55ce672f">
      <SceneProperties Length="7/8" Page="17" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="VERBENA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text> - Morning</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ab776bfe-d521-441f-bda0-a1ecb548739e">
      <Text>Everything is a circus. Several chrome-plated beetle-limos are parked haphazardly across the sidewalk.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c033b3a9-2b78-4569-9277-a2df5676e2e6">
      <Text>PARSLEY (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="7b334a02-0273-4177-919d-539489585127">
      <Text>(Tired yet wired)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="206c5998-c6a0-4f90-807d-091307ff396b">
      <Text>The Moon Fungus pollen has been safely stashed in my overalls, but it’s making my leaves itchy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c7d9f6d4-c16b-4a26-954a-9b51af95bdc2">
      <Text>PyRUS (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="206c5998-c6a0-4f90-807d-091307ff396b">
      <Text>Woody Holly has officially moved into our neighborhood!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6197602b-7fdf-4fa7-b17b-02e7905cffe3">
      <Text>ParSLEY (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="206c5998-c6a0-4f90-807d-091307ff396b">
      <Text>And they brought a ton of luggage.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ab776bfe-d521-441f-bda0-a1ecb548739e">
      <Text>A crew of </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">plants</Text>
      <Text> in headsets is hauling heavy film equipment into the salon.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ab776bfe-d521-441f-bda0-a1ecb548739e">
      <Text>Verbena is barking orders into a megaphone made of a hollowed-out gourd.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ee720987-df24-46d7-af69-a6cb0d9cb793">
      <Text>VerBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4f9e013e-9af8-4ff8-a9f3-9a16cc5fc13a">
      <Text>Everyone stay in your root-marks! Remember, we’re filming for GET, not some public access community garden! I want </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">gritty</Text>
      <Text>, I want </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">raw</Text>
      <Text>, but I want it to look like it cost a million bags of premium mulch!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4ee9862b-e072-4b5a-a60e-0657b6b75ee8">
      <Text>Parsley and Pyrus, disheveled and covered in fungi, slip past security. Verbena blocks their path with her clipboard.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="645f3e52-4fd7-490a-a959-f1aad69fcfe9">
      <Text>VERBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4c2d1eae-adac-41c0-b180-70cc45cf0db8">
      <Text>You’re late! The talent is already here, and she’s complaining that the vibes too oxygenated. Where have you been?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d7284465-e49b-4f14-817e-ca019f4f5e69">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4d520be3-b699-4311-8ebd-a6eebc15e26c">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Ope</Text>
      <Text>- Nature hike!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7879fc11-1d90-4de0-99a8-80decffda756">
      <Text>Rau (Pre-lap)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a77bdfbb-49cc-4fa6-acad-35d8c3e08d2b">
      <Text>Nature hike?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="167cf0ec-9163-4c94-804e-e458eba86fc8">
      <SceneProperties Length="1" Page="18" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LAMI">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">SALONTRO</Text>
      <Text> - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="97668ab9-0853-43d1-8d8c-b6093a22e379">
      <Text>The salon is unrecognizable. Neon "Mint Condition" signs hang from the vine mirrors.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="97668ab9-0853-43d1-8d8c-b6093a22e379">
      <Text>In a whirlwind of motion, Rau’s hands vibrate like a dozen frantic leaves as she preps the Paddy infusion. She wipes dirt from Parsley’s face before shoving the kids away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3a5e7271-09ca-474a-b0ac-627b759e9156">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d2293166-213c-4750-9861-dc9ad8e50803">
      <Text>You two look like compost.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="077551b5-a305-4414-b3c6-6c4488501b8d">
      <Text>Pyrus adjusts their hoodie.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a32c65e8-7b94-4fe8-8447-33e16c444b9d">
      <Text>PyRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f2f6c6a3-9440-498c-9044-a2736e0e9ea9">
      <Text>Compost is haute couture, ma’am. The next network we’ll book is Green Fashion Week!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e491c78d-1632-414b-86af-7c09ef2bbd47">
      <Text>In the center chair sits a mint plant with diamond-encrusted leaves, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="AllCaps">Lami</Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps"> Mentha</Text>
      <Text> (50s). She hasn’t slept in forever.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0e54f14b-bc86-4ae8-880b-56480967acd5">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e29b5887-35af-4557-ab26-864165e0b365">
      <Text>Rau, darling. If I don't look like a green goddess soon, I’m going to have my producers "edit" this salon out of existence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2e49b8a4-595c-41ef-a476-8c261604e603">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="1d4d881c-ac2a-472f-8df6-660729c8a3cb">
      <Text>(Sweating sap)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="be30516c-8ea6-48b7-824c-8b68d6e553af">
      <Text>Almost ready, Madam Mentha! Parsley! Get the misting-wand!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a13ab6b2-0ae3-458e-8cf2-b18ea98a4ad7">
      <Text>Parsley rushes to the back, pulling Pyrus into the supply closet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4443ac93-5e27-438b-9a1f-0762ce02b1b2">
      <Text>ParsLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ebd5947a-0641-4b04-b2ce-1d8fa8db190f">
      <Text>Okay, the Journal says we have to mix the green pollen with the Paddy </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">influsion</Text>
      <Text>. It creates a chemical barrier against the Supernova.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="610c2a6f-fc4a-47b1-84c8-e342bbc56b9e">
      <Text>Pyrus dumps the green-glowing Bombus into a spray bottle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2911d88d-4677-4553-8f0e-229a882f7ac9">
      <Text>Pyrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="67324117-96cb-49e2-93c0-325611d07967">
      <Text>Shake it, don't stir it. We want her stabilized, not carbonated.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="caecbb66-f05c-49f4-b6f9-5282106a7ec7">
      <Text>Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5bfc0533-5173-4639-bf7c-f7f80acb4713">
      <Text>Breath in. Breath out. This is it. The Greenlight moment.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="b134a949-d2b9-4fa5-92f9-aa67aabede40">
      <SceneProperties Length="6 6/8" Page="19" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BOMBUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LAMI">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY &amp; PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="VERBENA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text> - Moments Later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="72a00822-749c-4676-9716-e0585f0d55b7">
      <Text>VERBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="b7a504d5-4ea9-4f92-86c9-df0645e74401">
      <Text>(to the cameras)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e21df0d9-0ab0-4c04-a34e-f2cec95ffbfb">
      <Text>And... action!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="04d9d409-89c0-4ab0-89b3-5195189bb96a">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text> turns to the lens with a celebrity smile. She walks through the salon like she’s giving a guided tour</Text>
      <Text Size="10"> </Text>
      <Text>of</Text>
      <Text Size="10"> </Text>
      <Text>a</Text>
      <Text Size="10"> </Text>
      <Text>palace.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a63abc6f-7e2b-47ab-bf3d-9ebf8332ca86">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="32e42877-25cb-44df-ac07-a711bfbedd0b">
      <Text>Welcome back to </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">Mint Condition</Text>
      <Text>. Today, we’re keeping it "soiled" in Dirty City. I’m at </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text>, a "</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Paddish</Text>
      <Text> salon" where the roots are deep and the mist is... intense.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="16f33cf4-33dd-46f9-9f56-54f4e7e712cf">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text> gestures with a diamond-encrusted leaf towards Rau.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="14625d6a-20c1-4b2f-b7be-d6763253cf54">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">LamI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6316e05a-5fc6-4f28-81c6-e6fcd747d1fb">
      <Text>This is Rau Ram, the owner of </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text>. She’s a cilantro transplant from Paddy Kingdom with a dream. Say hi to the camera.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0117c142-abc3-4a8f-b3a2-8d1f6a5e8773">
      <Text>RaU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4762f0b9-6c66-4570-931d-8a00bdc5780f">
      <Text>Germinations.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b29ffb50-3b6c-457d-93f6-b26dbad363ef">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">LamI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3b7755ab-09c5-4f55-82a8-f723af9c7817">
      <Text>In like- your language.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9c843cf6-939f-4fd6-bf71-4fbbb51072dc">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d1c189c6-541e-4c70-8c92-309127d6e201">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Chào</Text>
      <Text>...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b36c89aa-68fc-465d-91fc-902d17190bb2">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">LaMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6316e05a-5fc6-4f28-81c6-e6fcd747d1fb">
      <Text>She can style any hedge at a moment’s notice.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="75c8db2e-3e01-425b-84cd-9c758bbad3e2">
      <Text>Rau waves her hands nervously.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6c2ac5cc-baa7-4d0a-b66f-ac80117001cf">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="863429de-6a83-46e1-88f3-af176e6ff9bc">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text> is the talk of Woodwork.  A haven for plants who want that "authentic adaptation" look. And today, Rau is giving me highlights so exclusive, it isn't even in the plot yet. It’s called </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Greenlight</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="55af45ea-b522-4ac1-a5c8-4dd4eb6d2bd1">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">The music kicks in</Text>
      <Text>: Vietnamese traditional zither music.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7e4fd01d-e9d1-4eb5-b8de-9c6ab46bb7cd">
      <Text>RaU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7e180b7d-b789-449a-9539-694517e3cf6f">
      <Text>Hold. Hold.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1b656d9d-780e-4538-a0e4-caa06ed081a4">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9e09f755-4332-4700-b3ca-c30edc45c863">
      <Text>Cut, you mean.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e5d90215-3779-494a-ace4-d80776290279">
      <Text>RaU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f4f04a77-e0f4-4d10-bf8b-64b2292649c4">
      <Text>Do we have to play this?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aabb8c25-b6dd-4db7-95ec-2e8182d86696">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">LamI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="75b3a6a6-1f9f-47a8-9e77-569c59c4bc19">
      <Text>Isn’t this the music of your land?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6437dcd8-17be-4869-a784-9fc21720dd2d">
      <Text>RaU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="df97da16-c285-4a24-97b2-d5aeb635bb2b">
      <Text>We’re in Woodwork, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text>. This land has </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">DJ</Text>
      <Text> Cauliflower.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="95c8a2c6-0178-4180-9254-7169bf3c738b">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">LamI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f6eda9cf-d9b1-46c1-acb0-01b42fca3240">
      <Text>Alright. Whatever doesn’t get your cruciferous in a bunch. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="55af45ea-b522-4ac1-a5c8-4dd4eb6d2bd1">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">The Music shifts</Text>
      <Text>: The traditional zither is scratched away by a hip-hop beat drop.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="72a00822-749c-4676-9716-e0585f0d55b7">
      <Text>VERBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3642887d-d78e-48c4-b80b-bc6ff23bdc6f">
      <Text>Rolling!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c20025f9-d4b7-4496-ad5b-47aa6e98da70">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text> sits on a salon chair.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d91ad14f-6791-41cc-b83f-9335ef7c4014">
      <Text>Rau begins the misting ritual.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d91ad14f-6791-41cc-b83f-9335ef7c4014">
      <Text>Parsley steps forward, holding the special sprayer. He mists </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text> with a fine, green-tinted cloud.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="12f0e964-1776-46b2-a497-eabb487c66e0">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="f3b2e3b0-47b4-45cc-9795-e9cee9eeaff3">
      <Text>(Inhaling)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1880e032-202a-4adc-b5bf-83872d0dd7f4">
      <Text>Ooh... that’s... refreshing. My stems feel like... moonlight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1f60ed73-193e-42de-a336-8e02fbfac2db">
      <Text>Pyrus leans over the “</Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Do Not Touch</Text>
      <Text>” lever.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e21b4675-a464-4801-b92f-f91789d5a3de">
      <Text>Pyrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ca87e4a9-8c38-47b4-b848-f088696c2ff5">
      <Text>Ready for the glow-up of the century, lil herb?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ff46e6f7-beb2-4cdf-8dbb-8168942aa779">
      <Text>Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="6d7ddf3c-552f-4413-bacb-08e382491c1c">
      <Text>(Nodding to the camera)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="193b5b4b-65d6-43e3-ba80-bde87fb9f09d">
      <Text>Ready.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="606fead7-e4db-4f85-b025-05644a2ab138">
      <Text>Pyrus slams the lever to "SUPERNOVA."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7be5d52c-2889-4faa-b343-a2f495352344">
      <Text>WHOOSH! The emerald light explodes. But this time, instead of smoke and green hair, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text> begins to glow with a perfect, ethereal, diamond-emerald brilliance. She looks incredible.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f6d8d0fa-40ef-431b-a2df-607a9d20371f">
      <Text>Verbena</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6f052e42-b7de-4379-b7b8-0f10778a2a3d">
      <Text>Yes! Yes! The saturation! Her hair’s synthesizing! This is the peak, Rau! This is the look G E T will soil themselves for!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fa0180df-5b72-4b39-baaa-007e05ae1d19">
      <Text>Parsley watches his mother as she laughs. First time in a long time, the weight is off her leaves. Parsley smiles until his thumb brushes the Furrow Book Journal in his overalls.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fa0180df-5b72-4b39-baaa-007e05ae1d19">
      <Text>The book pulses. Parsley’s joy vanishes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9dbcc1b1-a6e2-40ad-93af-a66a1eea3318">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="78eb9995-5f45-4622-9d93-e3656bb684ed">
      <Text>Pyrus... wait.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e1232617-059d-4338-9f5c-7baa32d9e71a">
      <Text>He shoves the journal under Pyrus’s nose. The pulsing ink now forms a warning symbol over </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami’s</Text>
      <Text> glossy diagram.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a22063d2-4486-44b7-ae09-3f7c3e510a0f">
      <Text>Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c5352904-9489-45ed-bc71-912b0e878da5">
      <Text>I thought we’re in the green. But look at the ink.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3420a6b2-c443-47d9-ac05-21fc9109ec9f">
      <Text>The "Supernova" page is pulsing with an angry, red sap-ink. Fresh text bleeds through: "</Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Moon Pollen side effect includes: Solar Gravity</Text>
      <Text>."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="07f3c307-77fd-4dcf-ba6f-09c34fd30be8">
      <Text>PyRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5dc68535-50cb-4d56-a4ed-b2bd9000f68b">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Ope</Text>
      <Text>. We’re still in the red.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="645f9019-f1fa-4946-aa41-0fb4399f3e98">
      <Text>ParSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3ec0bd62-9db7-4d96-9a97-c98922c8d23f">
      <Text Style="Italic">Solar</Text>
      <Text> gravity? Why not Lunar? It makes no sense. It’s a Moon Fungus! Not Sun?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="278f11e1-3ab6-47ca-a1dd-7575c185c00d">
      <Text>The page takes its time to ink out: “</Text>
      <Text Style="Bold">¯\_(</Text>
      <Text Font="Sans Mono CJK Final Draft" Style="Bold">ツ)_/¯</Text>
      <Text>”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5dd87cbc-916f-49c8-95d0-ae894e8740ea">
      <Text>PyRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="93ef0b84-a888-4986-b569-4addfb53b795">
      <Text>I also failed astronomy, bookworm! None of it makes sense!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="712d37b3-e1ca-416f-b115-d5e531b3adb3">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">CREEEAK</Text>
      <Text>. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami’s</Text>
      <Text> chair groans. Her chair is being pulled downward, sinking toward the floorboards as if the gravity beneath her has quadrupled.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fb8fad22-ffee-40b9-b1a6-901a28857b9f">
      <Text>Rau quickly grapples onto </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami’s</Text>
      <Text> chair with a vine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7ce7a0d1-533b-4116-b8d3-85b79ed84f2e">
      <Text>Parsley gets their camera.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="21e55c44-de58-408d-91cd-99a6a3df15b0">
      <Text>Parsley &amp; Pyrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="e5701b32-f5bc-469c-8102-f947c1d9ea60">
      <Text>(Dread)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="58f3489d-98cf-45ed-8eec-18138be92072">
      <Text>Photosynthesis... photosynthesis... Photo!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0a447c49-9c4b-48ea-b2cc-bd5b9ebfaf1c">
      <Text>Parsley snaps a photo of </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text> as she sinks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f9abc55b-7a8f-4286-91a4-3832a3d8914f">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Flash</Text>
      <Text>. The image captures </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text> looking like a glowing star, while a crack in the floor opens directly beneath her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1e13b8bd-77e3-4f5f-a767-c2fc737faf3f">
      <Text>Verbena rips away the photo and gets everyone back on track.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2b39f8ee-5b07-433d-a550-40800f7e278f">
      <Text>VERBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fe3d118c-2912-461c-a1c1-b6edf547f4de">
      <Text>No photosynthesis allowed on set!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="faf77480-b338-4b4b-a164-497a580f4d89">
      <Text>Verbena pushes a cameraperson closer. Her shades fly off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ad1acaa0-1885-4285-b38f-22bedf476f6a">
      <Text>VERBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="20bd0d1e-8469-4963-831f-967ab730c835">
      <Text>Get the wide shot! The way the ground is crumbling around her diamonds... it’s a commentary on the fragility of fame! It’s high-concept! It’s G E T TV gold!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5f2cddad-9e5e-44a6-9cea-a636627abe2a">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b884bcfb-2dc1-4c28-9ca0-5bb5e6d4a278">
      <Text>I’m going to blow up!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ffbf276a-a166-42f8-80de-501964b283a6">
      <Text>Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c2ce262f-6111-4688-9ed2-340527868f82">
      <Text>Actually, Madam Mentha, you aren’t going to blow up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8e337eca-4f72-4a80-9d03-568458e9f0dc">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="61ec7f38-ca48-49f2-8a70-e0a7435f534c">
      <Text>Not helping, son.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2bf6df97-8c7c-4d47-956a-3b46988d2be5">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e1e813b8-ee37-4d77-b412-89e2e4343ad6">
      <Text>A common misconception! Blowing up is an outward release of energy like grapes in a microwave.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e61f48ae-9688-469e-9071-dfd48d372845">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Quick animation</Text>
      <Text>: </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Grapes</Text>
      <Text> sit in a microwave. They glow, expand like balloons, then </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">pop</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="1a0b4da2-8bb6-46a2-af0d-7d85eff6da6a">
      <Text>BACK TO SCENE:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0663a16a-185b-4272-8aa3-5cdedce28ee6">
      <Text>ParSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e1e813b8-ee37-4d77-b412-89e2e4343ad6">
      <Text>What you're experiencing is </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Italic">cytorrhysis</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6ca53322-0455-4fad-9442-0f71ce277f24">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">LAMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d3112e2f-fd0d-4618-b246-e36bf450598c">
      <Text>Cyto-what? Is that a designer brand?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3231629e-377c-43a1-9b0d-394f3babfeb4">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="38562cbe-1f11-4688-8727-a0f04d75f354">
      <Text>The design is... rather than exploding, you're going to collapse inward until you're a tiny, dense minty ball.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8a7d2450-51e0-4885-9b64-772965e367b6">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ec188a05-269e-4327-9881-7840cd04f18a">
      <Text>Are you dense?! </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text>, he means you'll be lean by the end of this!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="13ea1c24-3fbb-4375-9cd9-e1fe4ce19498">
      <Text>The hip-hop track distorts. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text> is waist-deep in the floor, her chair disappearing into a hole that oozes neon-green sap.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7a01c65c-e079-4276-b9ed-99848048929c">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">LAMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="7d5b8778-bc56-4d4b-98e3-e6ce8a3f357b">
      <Text>(Voice vibrating)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="20dc2fc8-d6d3-45a1-bcb2-3469b510ff60">
      <Text>The exfoliation is so... tectonic. Rau, I can feel the very heartbeat of the planet. Is this part of the transplant experience?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3562c814-d091-4d53-aa1a-076a6169e5b7">
      <Text>RAU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="f28df29a-4df0-4f1c-8717-aa17bef5394d">
      <Text>(Losing her grip)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2ffd38d7-2f4d-43e9-a40b-0613e0a96150">
      <Text>Exactly! It’s... </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">Geo-Rejuvenation</Text>
      <Text>! Parsley! Whatever setting you put that steamer on, turn it down before we’re looking for a new salon at the bottom of a sinkhole!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4f861be1-a6c7-4440-b0eb-1957cf6a0f2f">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ad7d7339-c8e9-49ae-aa2e-ebfc44691f8d">
      <Text>I can't turn it down! It wasn't the steamer! Pyrus and I swapped the mist for Moon Fungus pollen!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b8a1ea6c-e863-4684-bd26-1862eeb45e94">
      <Text>RaU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="0e386cf7-7a10-4548-87a1-172b7f00a590">
      <Text>(Eyes wide)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4c749a32-d414-4eb8-b626-549d206130ec">
      <Text>Moon Fungus? That nature hike?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="acfdaa87-ad17-42c6-bc11-3208ea1e9dcf">
      <Text>PaRSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fcf3434a-473e-43f2-8a31-629cca8d0e6c">
      <Text>It’s increasing her density by a five-thousand percent! She’s not a superstar anymore... </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami’s</Text>
      <Text> a black hole!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4bab711e-6e78-45ed-9b8e-f82175257ac8">
      <Text>VerBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2e6c635a-8e0a-4c32-802b-34341d540d78">
      <Text Style="Italic">Black</Text>
      <Text> hole?! This is G E T, not B E T!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="23120b5b-1ea2-42ba-96c8-d4cb0c5a3da7">
      <Text>Pyrus slides across the slick and sappy floor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="876a6b9f-3483-4605-bfe4-904e1ba06722">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3529c1a6-c62b-4d21-8a50-30e20a493614">
      <Text>Lil herb! The sap-line is gonna blow! If she sinks another inch, we’ll be sent straight to Woody Holly!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d0f66324-6c56-4065-b4f9-c67d617db07b">
      <Text>Parsley flips through the Furrow Bark Journal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c1a4efb8-48a6-4ace-a9bd-953a99bd6520">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0a0978d6-9458-4fb0-b500-cdc6527a5490">
      <Text>I’m looking! I’m looking! Wait—here! "In case of heavy-heartedness or high-density distress, apply high-frequency vibrations to reset the cellular pitch!"</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9a6ba1f9-1623-4217-8a28-b1364fb24007">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fb4016ff-53db-4fb6-a9f3-c24b3dd6ea0e">
      <Text>Pyrus, the saxhorn! We need to rattle her molecules back to a lighter frequency!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a99ec6e5-01ff-4ebd-8ebe-61dc5fdbd7b2">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3c6a6a16-b565-4c26-b592-a3fded91515d">
      <Text>I’ve been waiting my whole life for someone to say those words.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d8c78139-1cc9-4ef9-b6c4-fe355d440bac">
      <Text>Pyrus whips a battered saxhorn from their hoodie. They take a deep breath, their cheeks puffing out like a ripe gourd.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="75a57404-bdaf-4ae9-be9f-440a3b266bf1">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a91846e8-d7d6-4051-b5ad-ab7831734c44">
      <Text>One, two, three... JAM!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d2832992-4d89-4540-a35c-0b4cf4395c28">
      <Text>Pyrus blasts a dissonant, ear-splitting </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">jazz-fusion chord</Text>
      <Text>. It’s messy, it’s loud, and it’s perfectly high-frequency. Bombus dives into the center of the sound wave, his wings vibrating so fast they become a transparent blur.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="038dec75-dcb6-4992-840d-c18104d9fb2e">
      <Text>BOMBUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f3331599-8faa-4244-8b06-9d0fa2dfa8c3">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">BBBBBBBBUUUUUUZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="20a9bbc8-1a5c-4908-88d9-5da8fe8af57b">
      <Text>The air in the salon literally shakes. Dust falls from the ceiling. The emerald glow on </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text> flickers violently. It turns from solid green to a translucent, airy teal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6ae9225c-8668-43b3-b7ad-f4f96ac54158">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">LAMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="3cf6213d-4a50-4de9-8812-a2425064d328">
      <Text>(Giggling)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="35878d3f-589d-4fed-be39-51cc6801b151">
      <Text>Ooh! It tickles! I feel... greenlight! I feel... effervescent!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="84a18a86-b526-4fe6-bad9-a37effc00d46">
      <Text>With a sound like a giant suction cup being released: </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">plop</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="84a18a86-b526-4fe6-bad9-a37effc00d46">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text> begins to float. She rises out of the sap-filled hole, her chair still attached to her roots, bobbing gently toward the ceiling like a minty cork in a pond.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="625b6fcf-8cd7-412a-a373-af8c2076a664">
      <Text>Rau anchors </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a93bb2e3-749a-45e9-9869-9ad37d5876e0">
      <Text>RAU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5c2fb133-6707-4e0c-a550-e9074910b269">
      <Text>Got her! She’s light as a dandelion seed!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9c37539a-4b25-4eb6-9d53-21723639c60f">
      <Text>Verbena checks her monitor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4ab5cab7-e498-4b7a-9b91-eaafbf6068c0">
      <Text>VERBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="29ae55fa-da06-4953-8832-2c2290c45ac8">
      <Text>The physics make zero sense, but the visuals are breathtaking. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text>, look into the lens and give me "Ascended Goddess!"</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9fd2b6b1-0c40-4f5e-ac0e-595fc7cdb512">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ac97a590-46f0-4555-b856-10a82256561a">
      <Text>We saved </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text>! We saved the salon from the superstar!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="51c6e213-a852-4019-ba07-a136b2d8c036">
      <Text>Parsley looks as the Journal sends one more footnote: "Warning: Floating may cause temporary loss of common sense."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2c5952d0-57a9-4a13-867f-390eac7766e2">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text> floats upside down, in deep fascination at the abyss. Her face is lit from below by the neon-green sap, giving her a ghostly glow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3e31e761-0c37-4760-897c-91fa8aea9c93">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">LAMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="38b81d65-a531-48b2-9036-a6c4b882ef72">
      <Text>It’s giving “Deep-Rooted Despair.” I’d like to buy this hole. Rau, can we incorporate the sinkhole into the permanent aesthetic? It’s so </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">underground</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bbb19a8c-f308-4d26-86cc-2bb57b228ab5">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text> turns to the camera.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d1393b1f-b3a6-4f56-b091-3c279333e752">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">LAMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c5ec6625-9898-4b15-b49f-47c691bbc929">
      <Text>In the garden nation of Woodwork, you have to dig deep to find your shine. Stay soiled, my sprouts.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b93f10cf-26dc-4970-a256-2f9429ce308d">
      <Text>VERBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="29127b77-dfb5-4865-b396-b651d7c2cbbd">
      <Text>That is a wrap on location! Someone get me a production photo for the G E T social media!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="16fa62bd-9a1f-4768-919a-4bc414623a58">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b25a33f6-28cc-4dd9-ab37-cda5c3502a87">
      <Text>Oh? I thought there were no photosynthesis allowed on set?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5f7250f5-aa95-46ae-8d4e-1692e63cca94">
      <Text>Verbena snatches a pair of oversized shades from the crew.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8f73fef7-de84-4e75-8b84-21c23e132411">
      <Text>VERBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1b8d4223-887c-4d50-9b9c-03db791fd094">
      <Text>Rules are weeds, kid. I pull them when they get in my way. Everyone, get in the hole. I mean, the shot!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7b74f2f5-d076-4e7c-becd-d275370bca25">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Flash</Text>
      <Text>. The image captures </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text> pointing into the glowing sinkhole, Rau and Parsley winking, Bombus dangling Pyrus over the hole, Verbena tripping, and the production crew.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2b4e7984-a415-4c3f-ba25-146900cdcba4">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Pre-lap</Text>
      <Text>: The sound of truck doors shutting.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="296319a1-f9fa-46ac-9005-aaa934db6021">
      <SceneProperties Length="3 3/8" Page="26" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHORUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="COMPANY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LAMI">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MALUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PARSLEY, PYRUS, RAU, MALUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU &amp; PARSLEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU, PARSLEY, PYRUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="VERBENA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text> - Later</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="807d6208-0a9e-48ac-88f6-bab5672ecc59">
      <Text>The last of the production trucks pack up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="72c73b25-564d-4aaa-97fa-4994497221cf">
      <Text>The giant hole is under construction.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="807d6208-0a9e-48ac-88f6-bab5672ecc59">
      <Text>Verbena hands Rau a signed "Golden Leaf" contract.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2e416320-2257-49fe-b323-1d042f0c1cac">
      <Text>VERBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="46c4071d-de17-4026-a214-3f49a05425a0">
      <Text>This "Greenlight" segment is going to be the highest-rated episode in Mint Condition history. You’re the highlight, Rau. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text> is...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6f45c1f2-75b4-42f4-95e2-703c7ebdb3c4">
      <Text>Rau seems dazed, clutching the contract. She forces a smile.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c87f70a2-2dcb-4636-b434-549dc37745bc">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a66fb8ef-49d0-4c0b-8a17-8a66ac072523">
      <Text>Green-la-la- We’re in the green...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4264224d-e943-4cdb-8cd1-7012d390207c">
      <Text>VerBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="50ecef3a-d296-45ed-b5ea-19e1ebe475a4">
      <Text>Red alert. Not quite. I can’t believe we forgot the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="Italic">afterpartyyy</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="de4dec17-f3d9-43c8-966a-eb3e3689665f">
      <Text>The GET production crew quickly returns and installs neon lights. Verbena snaps her fingers. RAU strikes a pose.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d76d894f-5229-44c0-aa1c-1f37db9312ab">
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">“Greenlit” Song</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a805a54d-4df8-4913-964c-0e8008271334">
      <Text>RAU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b756200c-c9c3-4f31-8a10-577528b97a59">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">I’ve spent years trying to blend</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="232b039e-11d4-4d42-a3a9-f347351cc178">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Pruning every branch so I wouldn’t offend</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="309e62bb-4ece-453a-b4a1-66610eebd0ff">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">A garnish on the side, a flavor they forget</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c974bc7a-b058-48cf-a7ed-719998b9d06a">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">But us invasive species haven’t peaked just yet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="878fb608-c63a-4947-9da5-67961c64b11d">
      <Text>PARSLEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c8bc8f1c-e9aa-4c65-8b7a-9a03672f1240">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">I’ve been sweeping up the dirt, trying to stay small</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="36fdd14a-cdf1-4d8e-aeaf-663a7c338d25">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Building up my roots behind a garden wall</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="df485728-a471-48a4-b3a7-67c7c87d6012">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">They told me "Stay safe, blend into the mulch"</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="abd7288c-5007-4409-b5b6-4ff64a2e3afa">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">But I can feel a rhythm in the cellular pulse.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d2e7659b-605e-49a0-b0db-b55bbc173a91">
      <Text>Rau &amp; Parsley</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="713c5004-f67d-4529-8f41-954e5acc4f72">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">No more living in the cracks of the sidewalk stone</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="266bf2d6-6f77-4fbc-a472-a49d8699f5a7">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">No more growing in a shadow that we’ve outgrown!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="63865844-b3b0-4406-8323-80e369c93915">
      <Text>Rau, Parsley, Pyrus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1dc64728-211c-4f53-9b47-a99eeb29102d">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">We are greenlit!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="de9264cc-ff0b-433d-9243-f17d4c7d12ee">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Finally stepping out of the grey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="59252f6a-cb18-4435-86e9-e5e2ef332dac">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">We are greenlit!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b37e7ccb-04c8-4fc1-ab41-944334fea20f">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Let the chlorophyll lead the way!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2f4f4e98-ef58-4fef-91ce-a055ac3a71e2">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">We’re not just a garnish, we’re the whole canopy tree</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4943063a-a2a5-4df9-b1fc-84ee51cb68d1">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Finally blooming for the world to see!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="92b657b6-2847-4fa8-84c3-96b9e0d9aca6">
      <Text>Chorus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="71ab66a9-faa1-488e-8311-da68c3a70b68">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Photosynthesis! Photo-photo-photo!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1fb3f5fd-7cbd-483a-873e-b90b83032d60">
      <Text>PYRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="abb60ce6-b54e-4d92-adda-ea93ecd7a492">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="AllCaps">Ope</Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">! Look at the lens, look at the glow</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c7204e40-9132-46f5-baef-40064356b659">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">We’re the main event, we’re the center of the show</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7068a3a3-c99f-470e-8e97-7516bf3e2103">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">They used to walk past, they used to look down</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8b4626e6-bc9b-45db-b41c-a71ee196abdc">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">But now this Dirty City wears a neon crown!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9fc2c1fa-0b90-4dfb-b2a6-f4bbae9093fd">
      <Text>RAU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2c291435-3323-49a5-ace3-50f5181c4440">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">I want them to know my name and my face</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cfa52d73-752d-42d8-811e-e2b9e9147d8c">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">I want to be more than a transplant in this space!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="946e8125-7a4f-4174-95bd-b708bbcc36c3">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Respect is the water, fame is the sun</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="91a3d31c-f4b3-4558-bc1b-31c04cd1c083">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">The season of hiding is finally done!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aec2d8d3-1cbb-4484-909f-d1cb6a0b127e">
      <Text>Company</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b78b5743-bb97-4ff5-b936-2a2fd44b3c03">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">We are Greenlit! (Photosynthesis!)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bb3ef4d0-5d04-4741-b70c-b5cba28d2e5e">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">We’re greenlit! (Photo-photo-photO)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7ac1b717-fa92-4ece-be72-116ea485847c">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">The canopy is open, our leaves believe</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="16addc12-6057-4d6c-bbaf-792e05cdffca">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">The world finally sees...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3a81a94d-309d-47d1-8ce2-d5e51722afe9">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">The color of our dream!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5cfecf5b-9a5e-41a7-8ecb-8f7fcb51fd2c">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">We’re GREEN!
Lit!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1cc6e08a-b415-4031-855d-b2c85e79af2f">
      <Text>Underneath the strobe lights, Rau and Parsley stand triumphantly amongst the other plants.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="52511e55-b169-420f-9542-d6c2adfabe0b">
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">End of “Greenlit” Song</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="68d9fa68-8fac-4644-9f0c-6610329778fc">
      <Text>VerBENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7e9a3e6b-4cd9-48e0-8a6c-35338f35a9de">
      <Text>Pear. We got to get your saxhorn on a future episode.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d3eb5a64-fd3f-4efe-a2f1-e8051c11fa39">
      <Text>Rau crosses her arms in defiance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e9f30271-1a24-4cc9-bac8-d94620404a61">
      <Text>RaU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="600eeebf-4122-4a6f-aa26-51790f9ddf86">
      <Text>Redlight that idea.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0a731d7c-0a80-421d-871b-43baf114a0f9">
      <Text>Verbena smiles and struts to her limo.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0a731d7c-0a80-421d-871b-43baf114a0f9">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text> pauses at the door, her skin faintly shimmering emerald, and winks at Parsley.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="00075a5d-f6d6-48f8-87b7-c8012216da74">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="aaae3e38-6fa6-4c40-9725-e9ed00dcabc4">
      <Text>(With a knowing smirk)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="76a41f95-85a5-4f0e-9521-422c34284be3">
      <Text>Unbe-</Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">leaf</Text>
      <Text>-able work today, garnish. But tell your mom if my leaves feel this heavy tomorrow, I’m sending my lawyers to prune this salon and garnish your wages.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="24d91f56-7b93-4e40-a50f-d18c90bbc95c">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Lami</Text>
      <Text> heads off to her limo.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="aa85005b-e3a3-46af-a559-70c679845f48">
      <Text>Pyrus nudges Parsley.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="180a75fb-c277-4cdc-96a4-e14b676145a3">
      <Text>PyRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3b79a1f8-9ff6-4f38-8d67-3eababcd1246">
      <Text>She just called you "unbe-leaf-able." </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">But let’s ignore the part about the lawsuits</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f2995ddf-2691-456c-9e7f-9f13267032fa">
      <Text>ParslEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0f2413a0-64bb-4221-af44-ac8046b6e120">
      <Text>That’s our motto. You returned the Journal?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0b8802fa-fb36-4514-b18e-a28f7e36e482">
      <Text>PyRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e02f52d8-0e4a-49ed-9ac7-e17e208350be">
      <Text>Now </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro’s</Text>
      <Text> a library? I’ve never returned a book to a library.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b5742104-9429-486f-8eba-97adb4a4f996">
      <Text>Parsley is about to spray Pyrus with the Moon Fungus juice.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="531be3ba-db1b-4a2e-8714-56b556948fdf">
      <Text>PyRUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9bd41c2a-53e8-4c85-90f0-485cdb425379">
      <Text>Okay </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">okay</Text>
      <Text>! Supernova is super no more.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c50cc3a4-f72d-4f40-be55-12dea3752790">
      <Text>The limos and trucks speed off, immediately lining up behind the broken redlight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1fd8659d-668b-44d8-a0f4-163a57ef1264">
      <Text>Malus walks over from </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">FigLeaf</Text>
      <Text>, leaning against the doorframe, watching the line of vehicles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="19c31241-5120-45f7-9705-3833e8db870b">
      <Text>Malus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="971aff47-12f1-49da-bfe2-5493587fe847">
      <Text>They really </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">needa</Text>
      <Text> fix that light.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="89e73448-7200-4d4d-b7d7-e6fe4dc3714c">
      <Text>A loud </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">crunch</Text>
      <Text>. The floorboard underneath Rau caves in. Rau yelps, vanishing up to her knees in the dark crawlspace.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e4269421-7532-4f35-a00b-250fa4108303">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="57186ba8-fef0-4b8c-bc21-1eee10d5fe24">
      <Text>...And my floorboard.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fbf8b80b-742a-4644-a4d0-234d9516360a">
      <Text>The tension also breaks. Malus, Parsley, and Pyrus burst into laughter.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="75a88437-6e16-477b-a047-8065a7b8a43a">
      <Text>Bombus lands on the edge of the hole. With lightning speed, they dip their stinger into the green sap and inks text across the floorboards: “</Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Wanna greenlight a photo</Text>
      <Text>?”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ee16c476-3a0c-4af3-a12c-4f2b5ed62c71">
      <Text>Rau</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ff3623f8-8fec-4f17-b9e9-f5c2964c6def">
      <Text>Whatever, honey...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0b0e5795-94a3-485c-bdc5-51d886d89677">
      <Text>Bombus gets out the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salontro</Text>
      <Text> cam. They buzz to the tune of “Photosynthesis.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="262cd8f7-2762-40e8-b9ac-f9a15e01849c">
      <Text>Parsley, Pyrus, Rau, Malus</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9e6c5d15-a0dc-4895-9247-e51404b97517">
      <Text>Photosynthesis... photosynthesis... Photo!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="30e983dc-2989-4185-9033-c805e15b6251">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Flash</Text>
      <Text>. The final photo captures Rau dripping with gooey ointment and holding the contract, Malus being chill, Bombus soaring, Pyrus making a jazz-hand, and Parsley looking into the camera with a look that says: I’m just getting started.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="92e92627-cfff-4e6c-bbae-2d7791f0473b">
      <Text>On the bottom of the photo is a hand-written glowing green text: “Photosynthesis was </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Greenlit</Text>
      <Text>”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="End of Act" id="c0a95428-52eb-42b1-bfa7-8876bbd34885">
      <Text>End of Pilot</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0111b406-c462-4e31-81e4-41bf32f3b9c8">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Visual cue</Text>
      <Text>: The end credits feature a montage of all photos taken throughout the episode, interspersed with behind-the-scenes production stills and concept art. The images are a scrapbook of the adventure and spirit of “Photosynthesis.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>

